     PHPBenelux is back!

     After 11 successful editions, the leading PHP conference in Belgium, the Netherlands and Luxembourg is back for a one-day event on Saturday January 23 2027. Join us in Antwerp for a new chapter of technical excellence, community, and connection.

     <a href="https://pretix.eu/phpbenelux/conference2027/">Buy your tickets here</a>, and visit <a href="https://conference.phpbenelux.eu">https://conference.phpbenelux.eu</a> for more information about the conference.
